    "compose_patient": {
      "sections": [
        {
          "section_id": "c_sections.0",
          "heading": "why_in_hospital",
          "source_ids": [
            "sections.0",
            "sections.1"
          ],
          "text": "You came in because you had:\n- a sudden droop on the right side of your face\n- weakness in your right arm\n- difficulty speaking\n\nThe team found you had an acute ischaemic stroke.\n\nYou also have these background conditions:\n- an irregular heartbeat (atrial fibrillation)\n- high blood pressure\n- type 2 diabetes"
        },
        {
          "section_id": "c_sections.1",
          "heading": "what_we_did",
          "source_ids": [
            "sections.2",
            "sections.3"
          ],
          "text": "While you were in hospital:\n- A scan of your head on Day 1 showed no bleeding.\n- You were given a clot-busting medicine (alteplase) on Day 1.\n- A second scan on Day 2 also showed no bleeding.\n- A speech and language therapist assessed your swallowing.\n- Because swallowing was not safe at first, you were fed through a tube into your stomach (nasogastric feeding). Your swallow recovered on Day 3.\n- A blood-thinning medicine (apixaban) was started on Day 4 for your irregular heartbeat.\n- The early supported discharge team accepted you to help with your recovery at home."
        },
        {
          "section_id": "c_sections.2",
          "heading": "medicines",
          "source_ids": [],
          "text": "{{MEDICATIONS}}"
        },
        {
          "section_id": "c_sections.3",
          "heading": "next_steps",
          "source_ids": [
            "sections.7",
            "sections.8"
          ],
          "text": "- Community stroke rehabilitation has been arranged through the early supported discharge team.\n- You have a stroke clinic appointment at 6 weeks.\n- Your GP will check your blood pressure and your diabetes blood test (HbA1c)."
        },
        {
          "section_id": "c_sections.4",
          "heading": "safety_net",
          "source_ids": [],
          "text": "{{SAFETY_NET}}"
        }
